---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "David Bograd: Product Designer"
socialImage: david-bush.jpg
bodyClass: is-work
---

<section class="hero">
  {% if site.show.heroGraphics and site.show.work %}
  <a class="dial" href="#work">
    <svg class="dial__ring" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
      {% for i in range(0, 72) %}
      <line x1="100" y1="3" x2="100" y2="{{ 15 if i % 6 == 0 else 10 }}" transform="rotate({{ i * 5 }} 100 100)"/>
      {% endfor %}
    </svg>
    <span class="dial__label">Selected work</span>
  </a>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="shell">
    <h1 class="hero__title" data-split-words>
      I&rsquo;m <span class="word" data-cursor="me-cursor">David&nbsp;Bograd,</span><br>
      a product designer making<br>
      <em data-sparkle>beautiful software</em>.
    </h1>

    <div class="hero__roles">
      <div class="hero__role">
        <p class="hero__role-label">Currently</p>
        <p class="hero__role-text">
          Looking for my next role. Remote or <span data-cursor="au-cursor">Perth, Australia</span>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__role">
        <p class="hero__role-label">Previously</p>
        <p class="hero__role-text">
          Design @ <span data-preview="canva-preview">Canva</span>, <span data-preview="envato-preview">Envato</span>, <span data-preview="betashares-preview">Betashares</span> and more. Over the 12 years of experience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# These stand in for the pointer over my name and "Perth, Australia",
     and for the company names. They picture words already on the page, so
     they carry no alt text. #}
  <span class="cursor-chip cursor-chip--photo" id="me-cursor" aria-hidden="true" data-swing>
    <span class="cursor-chip__inner">{% image "david-avatar.jpg", "", "portrait", true %}</span>
  </span>
  <span class="cursor-chip" id="au-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="cursor-chip__inner">{% include "partials/flag-au.svg" %}</span>
  </span>
  <span class="cursor-chip cursor-chip--preview" id="canva-preview" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="cursor-chip__inner">{% image "preview-canva.jpg", "", "preview", true %}</span>
  </span>
  <span class="cursor-chip cursor-chip--preview" id="envato-preview" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="cursor-chip__inner">{% image "preview-envato.jpg", "", "preview", true %}</span>
  </span>
  <span class="cursor-chip cursor-chip--preview" id="betashares-preview" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="cursor-chip__inner">{% image "preview-betashares.jpg", "", "preview", true %}</span>
  </span>

  {% if site.show.heroGraphics %}{% include "partials/collage.njk" %}{% endif %}
</section>

<section class="section work" id="work">
  <div class="work-list">
    {% set studies = collections.casesVisible if site.show.work else collections.casesPlaceholder %}
    {% for item in studies %}
    {% set anchor = item.data.anchor or item.fileSlug %}
    <article class="study" id="{{ anchor }}" style="--case-accent: {{ item.data.accent }}; --logo-h: {{ item.data.logoHeight or '32px' }}">
      <div class="study__copy">
        <header class="study__mast">
          {% if item.data.logo %}
          <div class="study__logo">
            {% image item.data.logo, item.data.cardTitle, "logo", true %}
          </div>
          {% else %}
          <p class="study__name">{{ item.data.cardTitle }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          {% if item.data.years %}
          <p class="study__years">{{ item.data.years }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </header>

        {% if item.data.heading and item.data.heading != item.data.cardTitle %}
        <h2 class="study__title">{{ item.data.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if item.data.intro %}
        <div class="study__body">
          {% for paragraph in item.data.intro %}<p>{{ paragraph | safe }}</p>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if item.data.cover or item.data.thumb %}
      <div class="study__visual">
        {% image item.data.cover or item.data.thumb, item.data.coverAlt or "", "work", loop.first %}
      </div>
      {% elif item.data.placeholder %}
      <div class="study__visual study__visual--empty">
        <p class="work-soon__label">Coming soon</p>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-head__title">About me</h2>
      <div class="section-head__meta">
        <span class="section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="section-head__sub">If you fancy reading more, here&rsquo;s my short story.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__aside">
        <figure class="about__photo">
          {% image "david-wall.jpg", "David Bograd", "aboutPhoto" %}
        </figure>

        <div class="about__contact">
          <p>Don&rsquo;t be a stranger&mdash;Reach me at</p>
          <a class="about__email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">&rarr; {{ site.email }}</a>
          <p class="about__ps">PS. I don&rsquo;t always pose awkwardly in front of walls.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__social">
          {% for link in site.social %}
          <a class="pill" href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ link.label }}</a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about__text">
        <p>
          I most recently designed at <a class="link--canva" href="https://www.canva.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canva</a>, and I&rsquo;m looking for my next role.
        </p>
        <p>
          Previously, I worked at <a href="https://simplywall.st/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Simply Wall St</a>,
          where we made investing easier for over 7,000,000 users worldwide.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before that, I worked at <a href="https://envato.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Envato</a>
          where I built tools for Envato&rsquo;s marketplaces and contributors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Throughout my 10+ year of experience I&rsquo;ve worked for a handful of tech companies,
          designed websites for clients such as Microsoft, and freelanced for more than 100 clients.
        </p>
        <p>
          I&rsquo;m a self-taught Designer and had been working in the industry for a handful of years,
          before I went to Hyper Island where I studied Digital Data Strategy to broaden my skillset.
        </p>
        <p>
          When not working you can catch traveling and meeting new cultures. I like to stay active and
          spend time at the gym. If I&rsquo;m lucky and find a snowy mountain you&rsquo;d probably see me
          shredding slopes on my snowboard.
        </p>
        <p>I&rsquo;m based in Perth, Australia but originate from Copenhagen, Denmark.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
